      <AssociatedTemplateName>SGM-200 kill joys</AssociatedTemplateName>
      <Designation>SGM-200</Designation>
      <Nickname>kill joys</Nickname>
      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT - $MISSILESTAT_NONE - $MISSILESTAT_NONE</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-200 kill joys&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 2 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGM-2 body, which is a flexible mainstay anti-ship missile.  This missile will deliver no payload.  It has no on-board targeting capability or seekers..

